Package: SHIP
Type: Package
Title: Shrinkage Covariance Estimation with Prior Knowledge
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        "Vincent", "Guillemot",
        email = "contact@vincentguillemot.fr",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    ),
    person("Monika", "Jelizarow", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Estimates shrinkage covariance matrices from data using
    user-selected targets, including diagonal, constant-correlation, and
    knowledge-based targets informed by functional gene groups. The shrinkage
    intensity is computed analytically.
